    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: "Key Drivers:\n• Excessive discounting at 24% average vs other regions - 51% on Binders, 45% on Appliances, 40% on Furnishings destroying margins\n• 7 of 17 sub-categories operating at losses totaling -15,293, led by Furnishings (-3,906) and Tables (-3,560) \n• Furniture category bleeding -2,871 with -1.8% margin while Technology carries 85% of total regional profit\n• 62% profit decline from 2023-2024 with structural deterioration across Office Supplies\n\nRecommendations:\n• Immediately reduce discounting on loss-making sub-categories - cap Furnishings at 25%, Binders at 30%\n• Discontinue or restructure worst-performing SKUs in Tables and Appliances categories\n• Implement pricing controls to prevent margins below 10% on any sub-category"
